skillsLinkBody:
Creates a link to it in a folder {agent} reads, without copying files:
{link} → {target}

Use this switch to turn it off later; to undo, move the link to the Trash.

skillsMergeDiffBody:
The two copies differ: after merging, the agents that read this one switch to the active copy. Its content can be recovered from the Trash.

Move to Trash: {path}
Replace with a link to: {target}

skillsMergeSameBody:
The content matches the active copy, so what each agent reads stays the same.

Move to Trash: {path}
Replace with a link to: {target}
